ing-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">今週は➡</span></span></p><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><strong><span style="font-size: 22px;"><br></span></strong></span></p><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: center;"><strong style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 22px;"><font face="arial, helvetica, sans-serif">　　　　　　　　　～</font></span></strong><strong style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 22px;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Roboto, RobotoDraft, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap;">使わない家電の電源を抜く</span></span></strong><strong style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 22px;"><font face="arial, helvetica, sans-serif">～</font></span></strong></p><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: center;"><strong style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 14px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 22px;"><br></span></strong></p></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" id="e-1629622686575" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1629622686575"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left-lg gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs gf-elm-left" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-si